 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Presenting your experience",
     "texto": [
      "**Erfaring** means practical experience; **utdanning** means education or training. A **CV** summarises your studies, jobs and skills. **Søke en stilling** means to apply for a job."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two uses of «som»",
     "texto": [
      "You already know **som** with professions: **Jeg jobber som resepsjonist** («I work as a receptionist»). It also introduces a description: **en leder som hjelper meg** («a manager who helps me»). Here **som** means «who» or «that» and refers back to the person or thing before it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
